WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.172
Spark uses lazy evaluation for many operations.

00:00:04.172 --> 00:00:11.002
A transformation, such as selecting columns or filtering rows, usually adds to a plan.

00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:17.627
An action, such as show, count, collect, or writing a table, triggers execution.

00:00:17.627 --> 00:00:23.137
This gives Spark time to optimize the work before actually running tasks.

00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:31.062
Spark transformations are often lazy: they build a logical plan rather than immediately processing every row.

00:00:31.062 --> 00:00:37.667
An action triggers execution. That gives Spark an opportunity to optimize the plan.

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:45.262
Develop the habit of reading EXPLAIN output and asking which operations cause scans, shuffles, sorts,

00:00:45.262 --> 00:00:46.320
or exchanges.
